@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Microwave Oven

[*] --> Idle

state "Idle" as Idle
Idle : entry / Display current time
Idle : do / Wait for user input

Idle --> WaitingForInput : [User selects power level]

state "Waiting for input" as WaitingForInput
WaitingForInput : entry / Get power level selection
WaitingForInput : do / Validate power level selection
WaitingForInput : exit / Set cooking time or cancel

WaitingForInput --> CookingTimeEntry : [Valid power level selection]
WaitingForInput --> CancelCookingProcess : [Invalid power level selection]

state "Cooking time entry" as CookingTimeEntry
CookingTimeEntry : entry / Get cooking time input
CookingTimeEntry : do / Validate cooking time input
CookingTimeEntry : exit / Start cooking

CookingTimeEntry --> Cooking : [Valid cooking time input]
CookingTimeEntry --> CancelCookingProcess : [Invalid cooking time input]

state "Cooking" as Cooking
Cooking : entry / Start timer and display cooking status
Cooking : do / Monitor door state during cooking
Cooking : exit / Stop or cancel cooking

Cooking --> StoppedOrCancelled : [Door opened during cooking]
Cooking --> Cancelled : [User cancels cooking process]

state "Stopped or cancelled" as StoppedOrCancelled
StoppedOrCancelled : entry / Display current time and wait for next use
StoppedOrCancelled : do / Reset cooking status

StoppedOrCancelled --> Idle : [Next use]

state "Cancelled" as Cancelled
Cancelled : entry / Display current time and wait for next use
Cancelled : do / Reset cooking status

Cancelled --> Idle : [Next use]

@enduml
